.TH openalex-snapshot-extract 1
.SH NAME
openalex-snapshot-extract \- extract records by OpenAlex IDs using parquet indexes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openalex-snapshot extract
\-\-ids IDS.csv \-\-output OUT.parquet
[\-\-root-dir PATH] [\-\-dataset NAME|all] [\-\-profile safe|balanced|fast]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads IDs from CSV, routes each ID to a dataset, resolves matching rows via
`<dataset>_id_idx.parquet`, and writes output parquet files.

Output naming:
`<output_base>_<dataset>.parquet`

Routing:
- Entity prefixes: W, A, S, I, T, K, P, F, G, C
- Taxonomy namespaces: institution-types, work-types, source-types, licenses,
  countries, continents, languages, domains, fields, subfields, sdgs

Unknown IDs are skipped and reported.
.SH EXAMPLES
openalex-snapshot extract --root-dir /data --ids /data/ids.csv --output /data/extract.parquet

openalex-snapshot extract --root-dir /data --dataset works --ids /data/work_ids.csv --output /data/work_extract.parquet
